    a: 'Shoppers looking for authentic American sneakers can visit official brand outlets such as a Converse shoes store in Delhi located in major shopping centres like DLF Promenade (Vasant Kunj), Select Citywalk (Saket), and Connaught Place (Central Delhi). Additionally, premium multi-brand shoe stores delhi in South Extension, Karol Bagh, and Khan Market carry international US-sized footwear.'
